---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const MOMO_URL = "https://buymemomo.com/adarsha";
---

<Base
  title="Support Sajilo"
  description="Sajilo is free, with no ads and no accounts, and made by one person. Here is how to support it, with money or without."
  path="/support.html"
>
  <main class="wrap support" id="main">
    <p class="support-kicker" lang="ne">धन्यवाद</p>
    <h1 class="support-title">Support Sajilo</h1>
    <p class="support-lede">
      Sajilo is free. It has no ads, no account to sign up for, and it never sells what you do. It's
      built by one person in Nepal, in the evenings and on weekends.
    </p>

    <section class="support-momo" aria-labelledby="momo-title">
      <span class="support-momo-icon" aria-hidden="true">🥟</span>
      <div>
        <h2 id="momo-title">Buy me a momo</h2>
        <p>
          If Sajilo is part of your day, a plate of momo is the nicest way to say so. It keeps Sajilo
          free, and with enough support, puts it on the Mac App Store and Microsoft Store.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn--accent" href={MOMO_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Buy me a momo
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="support-block" aria-labelledby="pays-title">
      <h2 id="pays-title">What it pays for</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>The goal: the App Store and the Microsoft Store.</strong> With enough support, Sajilo
          goes on the Mac App Store and the Microsoft Store. It then installs like any other app, with
          no "can't be opened" warnings and updates handled by the store. Apple alone charges $99 a
          year to publish there, and that is what the momos are saving up for.
        </li>
        <li><strong>The website and domain</strong>, and the small servers behind notices and downloads.</li>
        <li><strong>Time</strong> for new features, and for fixing a source the day it changes.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="support-block" aria-labelledby="free-title">
      <h2 id="free-title">Ways to help that cost nothing</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Tell someone.</strong> Most people find Sajilo because a friend showed them.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Report what's wrong.</strong> A clear <a href="/report.html">bug report</a> is worth more
          than you'd think.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Star it on <a href="https://github.com/adarshaacharya/sajilo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a></strong>,
          which helps others find it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Suggest a number or website</strong> for the Directory, or a correction, by writing to
          <a href="mailto:contact@sajilo.fyi">contact@sajilo.fyi</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .support {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 720px;
    padding-top: clamp(40px, 7vw, 90px);
    padding-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .support-kicker {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--gilt-2);
  }
  .support-title {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 76px);
    line-height: 1.02;
  }
  .support-lede {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--paper-2);
  }

  .support-momo {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 36px;
    padding: 24px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gilt) 8%, var(--ink-2));
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--gilt) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .support-momo-icon {
    font-size: 44px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .support-momo h2 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 26px;
  }
  .support-momo p {
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: var(--paper-2);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .support-momo .btn {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .support-block {
    margin-top: 44px;
    padding-top: 22px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .support-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 24px;
  }
  .support-block ul {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--paper-2);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .support-block strong {
    color: var(--paper);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .support-block a {
    color: var(--gilt);
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .support-momo {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
